/*
  ABI Configuration file for the Fast Light Tool Kit (FLTK).

  Normally generated by configure/CMake from abi-version.in. Hand-provided
  here for the no-configure Dev-C++ build (build_fltk.bat).

  SOOB: raised from the default 10300 to 10304.

  The Fl_Text_Display line-number colour/font accessors -- linenumber_bgcolor(),
  linenumber_fgcolor(), linenumber_font(), linenumber_size(), linenumber_align(),
  linenumber_format() -- are 1.3.3 ABI features. Below 10303 the SETTERS COMPILE
  TO NOTHING and the getters return hard-coded values (linenumber_bgcolor()
  returns 53, "~90% gray"), because the backing members are themselves inside
  `#if FLTK_ABI_VERSION >= 10303` in FL/Fl_Text_Display.H. That is why the code
  editor's line-number margin rendered light grey no matter what colour it asked
  for. Raising the ABI is the documented way to enable them (see
  README.abi-version.txt); FL_ABI_VERSION must not exceed FL_API_VERSION (10311
  for 1.3.11), so 10304 is well inside the legal range.

  NOTE: this changes sizeof(Fl_Text_Display) -- it adds the six members above.
  libfltk.a AND every object that links it must be rebuilt together, or the
  layouts disagree. Delete vendor\fltk-1.3\FL\lib and raw\obj\fltk, then run
  fltk98.bat followed by ed98.bat / c98.bat.
*/

#define FL_ABI_VERSION 10304
